This project (esp32s3-mindustry-serpulo) is a standalone reimplementation/reimagining
of the Serpulo planet content and mechanics from the game Mindustry.

Mindustry (original game, sources used as the reference base: tag v160.7,
commit 17012d61d9e4c3cbd9820d87e81c24495486ac53) is licensed under the
GNU GENERAL PUBLIC LICENSE Version 3 (see LICENSE in the Mindustry source
distribution). This port is a derivative work and is intended to be distributed
under the same license, GNU GPL v3.

NOTE: the full text of the GNU GPL v3 must be included in this file before any
public release. It can be obtained from https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt

Original game: https://github.com/Anuken/Mindustry
This port:     https://github.com/homa95120-wq/-  (branch arena/4850dc2f-repo)

Game assets (sprites, sounds, fonts) of Mindustry may be subject to separate
rights; this port plans to use its own or freely licensed replacements. Verify
rights before distributing original Mindustry assets.
